## 3.0.8 (2026-08-20)

The first release cut from this fork. Everything upstream shipped in 3.0.7 is here,
plus the changes below. Upstream `pot-app/pot-desktop` is no longer updating, so this
fork's `master` is now its own release line.

本次是這個 fork 自行發布的第一版。上游 3.0.7 的內容全部保留，並加上以下變更。上游
`pot-app/pot-desktop` 已停止更新，因此這個 fork 的 `master` 從此走自己的發布線。

## Highlights

- **Follow-up chat on any LLM result** — carry a translation or an OCR result straight
  into a conversation, edit what you sent, regenerate an answer, and set a system prompt.

  **對任何 LLM 結果追問** — 把翻譯或文字辨識的結果直接帶進對話，可以修改送出的內容、
  重新生成回答，也能設定 system prompt。

- **Pause services without opening settings** — pause a service instance from the
  translate window itself, and let adjacent paused ones fold into a single row.

  **不必進設定就能暫停服務** — 直接在翻譯視窗暫停某個服務實例，相鄰的暫停項目還會摺疊
  成一列。

- **Failed translations say why** — a service that errors now opens its panel and shows
  the message instead of looking like it was never asked to translate.

  **翻譯失敗會說原因** — 服務出錯時面板會展開並顯示訊息，而不是看起來像從來沒被要求翻譯。

## New Features

- **Chat follow-up window** — a new window reachable from a translation panel and from
  the OCR result area, backed by a new `open_chat_window` command. Messages can be
  edited and resent, answers regenerated, and a system prompt applied per conversation.
  Localised for English, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese. (`4ad3139`)

  **追問對話視窗** — 可從翻譯面板與文字辨識結果進入的新視窗，底層是新的
  `open_chat_window` 指令。訊息可以修改後重送、回答可以重新生成，也能為每段對話套用
  system prompt。已在地化為英文、簡體中文與繁體中文。

- **Per-service pause toggle** — an enabled service instance can be paused from the
  translate window, which skips it when a translation runs while keeping it visible and
  resumable in place. (`256bbf9`)

  **個別服務暫停開關** — 已啟用的服務實例可以在翻譯視窗直接暫停，翻譯執行時會跳過它，
  但它仍然留在視窗裡隨時可以恢復。

- **Collapse adjacent paused services** — a run of two or more consecutive paused
  instances folds into a single row showing how many it stands for, and expands on
  demand. Off by default; enable it under Translate settings. (`130f23d`)

  **摺疊相鄰的暫停服務** — 連續兩個以上的暫停實例會摺疊成一列並標示數量，需要時再展開。
  預設關閉，可在翻譯設定中開啟。

## Bug Fixes

- **Translation errors are no longer invisible** — a failed run left the panel collapsed,
  so the error text rendered inside a wrapper laid out at zero height and never reached
  the screen. Every failure path now opens the panel: both the plugin and built-in
  service routes, in the automatic run and in translate-back, and the unsupported
  language-pair branch of each.
  (`d125691`, [#1](https://github.com/zeta987/pot-desktop/issues/1))

  **翻譯錯誤不再隱形** — 過去翻譯失敗時面板會維持收合，錯誤文字被排版在高度為零的容器
  裡，永遠顯示不出來。現在每一條失敗路徑都會展開面板，涵蓋外掛與內建服務兩種路徑、
  自動翻譯與回譯兩個入口，以及各自「不支援該語言對」的例外分支。

- **Plugin load failures surface too** — loading a plugin reads and evaluates its
  `main.js`, so a missing or malformed plugin rejects. Nothing caught that rejection,
  which left the panel collapsed and spinning with nothing to read. (`88bf487`)

  **外掛載入失敗也會顯示** — 載入外掛會讀取並執行它的 `main.js`，所以檔案缺失或語法損毀
  時 Promise 會被 reject。過去沒有任何地方捕捉這個 rejection，面板便一直收合著轉圈圈且
  毫無訊息。

- **Stale translate-back replies no longer seize the panel** — translate-back ran an
  asynchronous translation without any staleness check, so a slow reply overwrote newer
  output. Both entry points now take ownership of the panel through a shared run owner,
  and either one supersedes the other. (`391b0a5`)

  **過期的回譯結果不再搶走面板** — 回譯執行非同步翻譯卻沒有任何過期檢查，慢回來的結果
  會覆蓋較新的輸出。現在兩個入口都透過共用的 run owner 取得面板的所有權，任一方都能
  作廢對方。

## Improvements

- **Every translation runs through one helper** — the four call sites that started a run
  (plugin and built-in, in the automatic run and in translate-back) each spelled the
  whole course out again, which is why a one-line fix had to land in four copies.
  Behaviour is unchanged. (`6127615`)

  **所有翻譯統一由單一 helper 處理** — 原本四個啟動翻譯的呼叫點（外掛與內建，各自出現
  在自動翻譯與回譯）都把整條流程重寫一遍，所以一行修正得改四個地方。行為完全不變。

- **Replaced the archived drag library** — `react-beautiful-dnd` was archived by
  Atlassian; `@hello-pangea/dnd` is a maintained fork of the same code with the same API.
  (`bb2ad15`, [#2](https://github.com/zeta987/pot-desktop/issues/2))

  **替換已封存的拖曳函式庫** — `react-beautiful-dnd` 已被 Atlassian 封存，
  `@hello-pangea/dnd` 是維持相同 API、由社群持續維護的 fork 版本。

- **A test harness, and 63 tests** — Vitest with Testing Library and jsdom, plus V8
  coverage. The layout maths for paused runs, the panel reveal handle, the translation
  run helper and the run-ownership claim are all covered. (`d914b88`)

  **測試框架與 63 個測試** — Vitest 搭配 Testing Library 與 jsdom，並附 V8 覆蓋率報告。
  暫停群組的版面計算、面板開合處理、翻譯共用 helper，以及執行所有權的取得機制
  （run-ownership claim）都有覆蓋。

- **Project documentation for agents** — a `CONTEXT.md` glossary, architecture decision
  records, shared conventions in `AGENTS.md`, and issue-tracker and triage-label
  references. (`089b7bd`, `afe9a95`, `65229c6`, `f055638`, `6c76023`)

  **給 AI 代理閱讀的專案文件** — `CONTEXT.md` 詞彙表、架構決策紀錄、`AGENTS.md` 共用慣例，
  以及 issue 追蹤與分流標籤的參考文件。

## Inherited from upstream

Changes that landed in `pot-app/pot-desktop` after 3.0.7 and are included here.

以下是 3.0.7 之後進入上游 `pot-app/pot-desktop`、本版一併收錄的變更。

- Update ChatGLM models
  ([#1180](https://github.com/pot-app/pot-desktop/pull/1180)) by @wangrongding

  **更新 ChatGLM 模型清單**，由 @wangrongding 貢獻。

- Remove the `cmd.exe` wrapper in `run_binary` so plugin paths containing spaces work
  ([#1280](https://github.com/pot-app/pot-desktop/pull/1280)) by @idlefridaynight

  **移除 `run_binary` 中的 `cmd.exe` 包裝層**，解決外掛路徑含有空白字元時無法執行的問題，
  由 @idlefridaynight 貢獻。

- 21 Weblate translation updates covering Arabic, English, French, Hebrew, Italian,
  Korean, Norwegian Bokmål, Norwegian Nynorsk, Portuguese, Brazilian Portuguese, Russian,
  Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Spanish, Turkish and Ukrainian.

  **21 次 Weblate 翻譯更新**，涵蓋阿拉伯文、英文、法文、希伯來文、義大利文、韓文、
  書面挪威語、新挪威語、葡萄牙文、巴西葡萄牙文、俄文、簡體中文、繁體中文、西班牙文、
  土耳其文與烏克蘭文。

## Notes

- This is a personal fork of `pot-app/pot-desktop`, not an official release. The version
  number continues upstream's sequence for clarity, nothing more.

  本版是 `pot-app/pot-desktop` 的個人 fork，並非官方發布。版本號碼沿用上游序列只是為了
  辨識方便。

- Known limitation: a collapsed run of paused services does not open mid-drag, so an
  instance can be dropped before or after such a run but not into the middle of one. The
  reasoning is recorded in `docs/adr/0002-no-mid-drag-expansion-of-paused-runs.md`.

  已知限制：摺疊起來的暫停服務群組不會在拖曳過程中展開，所以只能把實例放在該群組之前或
  之後，無法放進中間。原因記錄在
  `docs/adr/0002-no-mid-drag-expansion-of-paused-runs.md`。
